Inspired by https://x.com/JFreshHockey and overall the Moneyball's approach to Wins Above Replacement (W.A.R)

Early version of my own calculated elo system for professional League of Legends players (https://x.com/ELOLCOM). Done as a passion project, to train and test my coding skills. 
As this being a bigger project than others on my git, I've decided to include comments in this file.

Time_Betting done as a test project with success over time, with a strong correlation between team elo difference and game time. 
Filters includes seasons and leagues, as they are two separate factors that significantly impacts game length as well.
